id: deconstructivism
direction: "Experimental composition with deliberate structural tension."

layout:
  - Controlled asymmetry
  - Offset decorative layers
  - Stable reading and interaction order

typography:
  - Expressive headlines
  - Conventional body text and labels

palette:
  - High-contrast foundations
  - Selective disruptive accents

components:
  - Broken-grid decoration
  - Editorial framing

avoid:
  - Overlapping essential text
  - Unpredictable controls
  - Visual order that contradicts meaningful reading order

supporting_use:
  - Decorative typography
  - Surface treatment
